; Bonus fruit timer (word)
;
; Countdown to the next bonus fruit. #R$6000 sets it to 2000 ($07D0) when a maze starts; #R$6922 decrements it once per
; call, that is once per pass for each released guard that is not waiting and has no red cell in its saved background
; (so it runs faster with more guards out). When it reaches 0 it is re-armed with 800 plus a random 0-1023 and a fruit
; is planted under the guard.
;
@label=FruitTimer
g$7C65 DEFW $0000
